                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye umwami Ahazi aja i Damasiko guhūra na Tigulati‐pileseri umwami w’i Ashuri; ashitseyo, abona igicaniro caho. Nuk’ umwami Ahazi arungikira Uriya umuherezi icitegererezo caco n’urugezo rwaco, uko cakozwe kwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Uriya yubaka igicaniro nk’ico, nk’ukw icitegererezo cari kimeze kwose, ico umwami Ahazi yamurungikiye ar’ i Damasiko; uko ni ko Uriya umuherezi yacubatse, kugira ng’ umwami Ahazi, ni yaza avuye i Damasiko, az’ asange cuzuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye umwami araza, avuye i Damasiko, asuzuma ico gicaniro; araheza aja kuri co, aracūrira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acoserezakw ikimazi ciwe c’ ukwosa n’ishikanwa ry’amafu, akivyagizakw ishikanwa ryiwe ry’ibiturire, akimijako n’amaraso y’ibimazi vyiwe vy’ishimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
