              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ urubaraza rusakaye rwubakiwe isabato, rwari rwubatswe ku ngoro y’Uhoraho, n’ikirimba umwami yacamwo kirora inyuma, abikūra ku ngoro y’ Uhoraho kubg’ umwami w’i Ashuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
