        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyose vyadonzwe kuri Ahazi, n’ivyo yakoze vyose, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabo c’ivyo ku ngoma z’abami b’i Buyuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
