              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Ahazi ahamvya ba sekuruza, ahambga hamwe na bo ku murwa wa Dawidi; maz’ umuhungu wiwe Hezekiya asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
